# Aulus, Warrior of Ferocity

> Aulus is a bruiser for drafts that can hold an enemy in the fight long enough for Fighting Spirit to take over. His rework turned him away from old crit patience and toward contact, control-immunity timing, and repeated area pressure. Pick him when your team can start the first crack.

